OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers will
OL,6,Fgradually fade this evening, leaving a
OL,7,Fmostly dry night with clear spells.
OL,8,FCloud building later bringing further
OL,9,Fshowers into the west. Much milder
OL,10,Fthan last night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FA bright start but cloud
OL,13,Fand outbreaks of rain will spread
OL,14,Feastwards through the day. Some
OL,15,Fbrighter interludes developing in-
OL,16,Fbetween the rain, especially in the
OL,17,Feast. Breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
