OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FStaying changeable on Thursday and
OL,7,FFriday, with rain at times. Humid with
OL,8,Fpossible mist and hill fog. Fresher on
OL,9,FSaturday, but plenty of warm sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
